@startuml
actor "Fleet Operator" as Operator
component "Fleet Dashboard" as Dashboard
component "Vehicle Simulator" as Simulator
component "Telemetry Gateway" as Gateway
queue "Kafka\ntelemetry.raw.v1" as Kafka
queue "Kafka\ntelemetry.rejected.v1" as Rejected
component "Telemetry Processor" as Processor
database "PostgreSQL" as PostgreSQL
database "Redis" as Redis
component "Fleet API" as API
component "Prometheus" as Prometheus
component "Grafana" as Grafana

Operator --> Dashboard
Dashboard --> API : REST HTTP/JSON
Simulator --> Gateway : TCP length-prefixed JSON
Gateway --> Kafka : publish(key=vehicleId)
Kafka --> Processor : consume
Processor --> PostgreSQL : lookup vehicle, sample e alert
Processor --> Rejected : domain rejection
Processor --> Redis : stato più recente
API --> PostgreSQL : query autorevoli
API --> Redis : cache-aside
Prometheus --> Gateway : scrape
Prometheus --> Processor : scrape
Prometheus --> API : scrape
Grafana --> Prometheus
@enduml
